# Cursor Rules
# Adapter — source of truth is in .ai/

## Onboarding
When starting work on this project, read these files in order:
1. `.ai/context/architecture.md`
2. `.ai/context/conventions.md`
3. `.ai/commands.md`
4. `.ai/status.md`

## Task workflow
Follow `.ai/workflows/task-flow.md` for every task.

## Commands
All build/test/deploy commands are defined in `.ai/commands.md`. Do not guess or hardcode commands.

## Conventions
All coding rules with examples are in `.ai/context/conventions.md`. Read before writing code.

## Coordination
Check `.ai/status.md` before starting a task. Update it when you start and finish.
